Note: Destination is ignored when you are exporting a report to an ODBC data source. You do not need to make any changes to the Destination edit box.
If your ODBC data source specifies a particular database, the report will be exported to that database. Otherwise, the ODBC Formats dialog box appears.
The program exports the report as a new table to the database you specified.
