1.2 Features of wire saw cutting technology
There are 12 Points to Note When Using Diamond Wire Saws
When adjusting the left and right position and direction of the drive flywheel, you must see whether there are obstacles around and whether it will hit other parts of the equipment. When the flywheel is adjusted to the end of the left and right positions, the adjustment should be stopped immediately, so as not to damage the screw nut or burn the motor winding.
When cutting, it is necessary to check the supply of cooling water from time to time. Once the cooling water supply is not in place, stop cutting immediately to avoid damage to the wire saw.
It is strictly forbidden to perform sawing operation when the power supply is lacking phase.
When the wire saw machine cuts objects, it must follow the principle of cutting the horizontal plane first and then the vertical plane. In the horizontal cutting process, a supporting wedge should be added to the saw gap that has been cut in time to prevent the rock from falling locally and pressing the wire saw, causing the wire saw to be scrapped.
When the wire saw machine is performing normal sawing operations, the position of the driving flywheel cannot be adjusted; when the position of the driving flywheel is adjusted, the sawing operation cannot be performed.
In severe weather such as thunderstorms or heavy rains, the sawing operation should be stopped as soon as possible, and all switches should be turned off in time. If necessary, move the equipment to a safe location to avoid danger.
Be sure to turn off the power supply and all switches after the end of the sawing operation or before leaving get off work.
If the equipment shell is found to be electrified during work, it must be shut down for inspection immediately, and the equipment can be turned on only after troubleshooting!
Regularly check the connections of wiring, wiring terminals, and plug connectors. If there is a problem, take immediate measures to ensure the normal operation of the equipment.
When an emergency occurs during the operation of the equipment, press the “emergency stop button” on the console immediately! Only when safety is ensured can the “emergency stop button” be reset!
Non-professionals are forbidden to modify the parameters that have been set in the inverter.
